@token2 =eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJhdXRoMCIsImVtYWlsIjoidG9tQG1haWwuY29tIiwiaWF0IjoxNzczMjU0NzczLCJleHAiOjE3NzMzNDExNzN9._hTn7lC3yxJ3PaoILCznql-nOzdigZmK-so56sysI5Y

### Login responsible (copy token into @token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auths/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "lea@mail.com",
  "password": "lea"
}

### Login regular member (copy token into @token2)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auths/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "tom@mail.com",
  "password": "tom"
}

### Create a team with responsible (should return 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/teams
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "TeamTest"
}

### Member sends membership request - responsible should receive notification (should return 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/teams/1/membership-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token2}}

### Check responsible received membership request notification (should return 200 with notif)
GET {{baseUrl}}/members/3/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Try to send membership request for non-existent team (should return 404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/teams/999/membership-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token2}}

### Try to send membership request without token (should return 403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/teams/1/membership-requests

### Approve membership request - member should receive notification (should return 204)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/membership-requests/1/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Check member received approval notification (should return 200 with notif)
GET {{baseUrl}}/members/4/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token2}}

### Member sends another membership request for refuse test (should return 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/teams/1/membership-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token2}}

### Refuse membership request - member should receive notification (should return 204)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/membership-requests/3/refuse
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "La team ne recrute pas actuellement"
}

### Check member received refusal notification (should return 200 with notif)
GET {{baseUrl}}/members/4/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token2}}